1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,740
两天，七张显卡送进维修店，
Two days, seven graphics cards at one repair shop,

2
00:00:02,740 --> 00:00:04,370
供电插头全烧了。
every power plug burned.

3
00:00:04,370 --> 00:00:06,660
每一张都是上万块的高端卡，
Each one a top-end card worth thousands,

4
00:00:06,660 --> 00:00:08,890
烧的却是一个小小的插头。
and what burned was a tiny plug.

5
00:00:08,890 --> 00:00:11,060
今天的问题：一个小插头，
Today's question: how does one little plug

6
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:12,980
凭什么烧掉一张显卡？
take down a whole graphics card?

7
00:00:12,980 --> 00:00:14,310
认识一下小卡。
Meet Xiaoka.

8
00:00:14,310 --> 00:00:17,070
小卡是一张显卡，胃口特别大。
Xiaoka is a graphics card with a huge appetite.

9
00:00:17,070 --> 00:00:19,890
RTX 5090 满载的时候，
At full load, an RTX 5090

10
00:00:19,890 --> 00:00:22,080
一张卡要吃掉575瓦。
eats 575 watts.

11
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:24,350
可显卡只吃12伏的低压电。
But it only eats 12-volt power.

12
00:00:24,350 --> 00:00:26,220
电压低，电流就得大。
Low voltage means high current.

13
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:27,710
575除以12，
575 divided by 12

14
00:00:27,710 --> 00:00:29,510
差不多就是48安。
is about 48 amps.

15
00:00:29,510 --> 00:00:32,460
家里两千瓦的电水壶，也就九安左右。
A 2,000-watt kettle at home draws about 9 amps.

16
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:34,140
小卡要它的五倍多。
Xiaoka wants over five times that.

17
00:00:34,140 --> 00:00:36,630
这48安，全从一个插头过去，
All 48 amps squeeze through one plug,

18
00:00:36,630 --> 00:00:38,890
插头里只有六根细细的针。
through just six thin pins.

19
00:00:38,890 --> 00:00:39,820
平均下来，
On average,

20
00:00:39,820 --> 00:00:41,240
一根针扛8安。
each pin carries 8 amps.

21
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:42,860
规范说，一根针最多
The spec says each pin can handle

22
00:00:42,860 --> 00:00:44,610
能扛9.2安左右。
about 9.2 amps at most.

23
00:00:44,610 --> 00:00:46,110
反转一：算一算，
Twist one: do the math,

24
00:00:46,110 --> 00:00:47,740
余量只有一成多。
the safety margin is only about 15 percent.

25
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:50,020
据估算，老式8针插头的余量
By common estimates, the old 8-pin plug

26
00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:51,020
接近一倍。
had nearly double.

27
00:00:51,020 --> 00:00:52,900
可平均8安不到上限啊，
But 8 amps is under the limit.

28
00:00:52,900 --> 00:00:54,050
怎么还会烧？
So why does it burn?

29
00:00:54,050 --> 00:00:55,200
想象六个人，
Picture six people

30
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:56,850
一起抬一架钢琴。
carrying one piano.

31
00:00:56,850 --> 00:00:58,580
要是有两个人手一松，
If two of them loosen their grip,

32
00:00:58,580 --> 00:01:00,600
重量就全压到别人身上。
the weight lands on everyone else.

33
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:03,010
电流也一样：六根针并排走，
Current is the same: six pins side by side,

34
00:01:03,010 --> 00:01:05,530
哪根接触好，电就往哪根挤。
and it crowds into whichever pin touches best.

35
00:01:05,530 --> 00:01:08,060
插头没插到底、针脚松一点，
A plug not pushed all the way in, a loose pin,

36
00:01:08,060 --> 00:01:09,340
接触就变差。
and the contact gets worse.

37
00:01:09,340 --> 00:01:11,300
反转二：硬件媒体实测，
Twist two: when reviewers measured it,

38
00:01:11,300 --> 00:01:13,200
有的线几乎没有电流。
some wires carried almost nothing.

39
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:14,080
而有一根，
And one wire

40
00:01:14,080 --> 00:01:15,250
高达22安！
carried 22 amps!

41
00:01:15,250 --> 00:01:16,570
比规范的上限，
That's more than double

42
00:01:16,570 --> 00:01:17,830
高出两倍多。
the spec limit.

43
00:01:17,830 --> 00:01:20,680
反转三，最反直觉：电流翻一倍，
Twist three, the weird part: double the current,

44
00:01:20,680 --> 00:01:21,950
发热翻四倍。
and you get four times the heat.

45
00:01:21,950 --> 00:01:23,720
因为发热等于电流的平方
Because heat equals current squared

46
00:01:23,720 --> 00:01:24,650
再乘电阻。
times resistance.

47
00:01:24,650 --> 00:01:26,820
22安只是8安的不到三倍，
22 amps is less than three times 8,

48
00:01:26,820 --> 00:01:28,280
发热却是七倍多。
but the heat is over seven times.

49
00:01:28,280 --> 00:01:30,640
更糟的是：热了，接触更差；
Worse: heat makes the contact worse,

50
00:01:30,640 --> 00:01:32,400
接触差了，又更热。
and worse contact makes more heat.

51
00:01:32,400 --> 00:01:33,970
一圈一圈往上滚，
Round and round it climbs,

52
00:01:33,970 --> 00:01:35,270
就像滚雪球。
like a snowball rolling downhill.

53
00:01:35,270 --> 00:01:36,450
热像仪一拍，
The thermal camera says

54
00:01:36,450 --> 00:01:38,340
插头烫到175度。
the plug hit 175 degrees Celsius.

55
00:01:38,340 --> 00:01:40,180
塑料外壳就这样化了，
The plastic melts,

56
00:01:40,180 --> 00:01:41,950
线和插头熔成一坨。
and cable and plug fuse into one lump.

57
00:01:41,950 --> 00:01:43,840
怎么防？第一，插到底，
How to prevent it? First, push it all the way in

58
00:01:43,840 --> 00:01:45,170
听见咔哒一声。
until it clicks.

59
00:01:45,170 --> 00:01:46,780
第二，线别贴着插头
Second, don't bend the cable sharply

60
00:01:46,780 --> 00:01:47,440
硬弯。
right at the plug.

61
00:01:47,440 --> 00:01:50,150
第三，有的高端卡会逐根测电流，
Third, some high-end cards measure each wire

62
00:01:50,150 --> 00:01:51,350
不均就报警。
and warn you when they're uneven.

63
00:01:51,350 --> 00:01:54,120
友情提示：每张卡到底为什么烧，
Friendly fine print: why each card burned

64
00:01:54,120 --> 00:01:55,710
厂商还没有定论。
hasn't been settled by the makers.

65
00:01:55,710 --> 00:01:58,930
我们讲的只是物理：余量小、电流不均，
This is just the physics: thin margins, uneven current,

66
00:01:58,930 --> 00:02:00,660
发热按平方往上涨。
and heat that grows with the square.

67
00:02:00,660 --> 00:02:02,200
小卡的新年愿望：
Xiaoka's new year's wish:

68
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:04,270
少吃一点，别上火。
eat a little less, and keep cool.

